sglang-cpp installs the native server next to its rank worker:

    bin/sglang_cpp_server
    bin/sgl_qwen_rank_worker

Pass --artifacts the package root, which contains the architecture
directory (sm90/ or sm121/) and registry/models-887c401e1.json:

    lib/sglang-cpp/

The server looks for sgl_qwen_rank_worker beside its own executable, or at
SGL_CPP_RANK_WORKER. CUDA, LibTorch, and NCCL are host libraries and are not
bundled in this port.
